Tests ability to design a scalable, compliant multi-tenant LLM gateway with region-aware routing, policy drift handling, and verifiable model attestations.

## Key Concepts
- Policy-driven per-tenant gating
- Region-aware model variant routing
- Data locality and compliance guarantees
- Verifiable attestations for weights and outputs
- Minimal API and data model design

